            ("Example 7 — Estimating a bill", "A school buys 498 desks at ₹1,985 each. Estimate: 500 × 2,000 = ₹10,00,000. Exact: 500 × 1,985 − 2 × 1,985 = 9,92,500 − 3,970 = **₹9,88,530**. The estimate differs from the exact cost by only ₹11,470, so the answer is sensible."),
